# Sources are LF everywhere. Without this, git on Windows checks out CRLF and
# `zig fmt --check` reports every file as unformatted (CI, windows-latest).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.zig text eol=lf
*.zon text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.env text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
